- Independent final review: clean, zero findings.

## Capture delivery remains separate

Current Central health routes responded `200`. Session capture still reports queued files:

```text
pi canonical outbox: 72
claude-code canonical outbox: 3
codex canonical outbox: 0
legacy ambiguous outbox: 374
```

A read-only replay preflight stopped on an existing byte-range mismatch. No outbox file was replayed, deleted, moved, rewritten, or quarantined. Archive repair remains a separate reviewed production operation.

## Rollback

1. Remove the `memory` entry from the shared MCP config.
2. Point Pi settings back to the prior clean package source.
3. Restart or reload Pi.

Rollback does not alter native transcripts, accepted Runs, flowing records, Brain pages, outboxes, or capture state.
